Subject: [PATCH] Track dual-stack logical uplinks and invalidate stale probes

Separate probe identity from ordered logical-interface aliases, preserve unknown
and pending state, require optional family default routes, and expose state
changes over ubus. Support IPv6 ICMP/TCP and validate the current ICMP request.
Close failed sockets and bound UCI records before publishing a probe.

